1. Open MySQL

Keep your FastAPI server running in one Terminal, and open another Terminal.

Run:

mysql -u root

Since your root password is empty, just press Enter if prompted.

2. Select your database

Inside MySQL:

USE fastapi_crud;

3. Check the tables
SHOW TABLES;

You should see:

books
4. Check the data

Run:

SELECT * FROM books;
Useful MySQL commands
USE fastapi_crud;

SHOW TABLES;

DESCRIBE books;

SELECT * FROM books;

To see only specific columns:

SELECT id, title, author FROM books;

To count records:
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM books;








